{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work-list", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"facets": {}, "total-results": 270271, "items": [{"issue": "3", "DOI": "10.18402/resci.2017.03.01", "type": "journal-article", "page": "379-395", "title": ["百年来的资源环境承载力研究:从理论到实践", "A review of resources and environment carrying capacity research since the 20th Century:from theory to practice"], "volume": "39", "author": [{"family": "封志明", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "FENG", "family": "Zhiming", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"family": "杨艳昭", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"family": "闫慧敏", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"family": "潘韬", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"family": "李鹏", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "YANG", "family": "Yanzhao", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "YAN", "family": "Huimin", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "PAN", "family": "Tao", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "LI", "family": "Peng", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "container-title": ["资源科学", "Resources Science"], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2017]]}}, {"issue": "2", "abstract": "<jats:p/>", "DOI": "10.62989/jetm2025.2.2.32", "type": "journal-article", "page": "143-147", "title": ["国土规划与资源环境承载力协调性研究"], "volume": "2", "author": [{"name": "Academic Frontiers Publishing Group", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "刘素梅", "family": "刘素梅", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "container-title": ["Academic Frontiers Publishing Group"], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2025, 2, 28]]}}, {"DOI": "10.32629/9789811413032", "title": ["水资源评价理论与实践研究"], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2019, 7, 1]]}, "type": "book", "abstract": "<jats:p>水在自然环境中,对于生物和人类的生存来说具有决定性的意义,没有水人类就不能生存,但是随着我国经济的日益发展,人口不断增加,生产力不断提高,我国现在的水资源问题越来越严重。水资源是指地球上水圈内水的总含量,其中包括人类日常生产生活中可以用到的地下水和地表水,同时也包括人类在日常生活中不会运用到的一些水资源,比如冰山或者是高山上的积雪。水资源是被人类在生产和生活活动中广泛利用的资源,不仅广泛应用于农业、工业和生活,还用于发电、水运、水产、旅游和环境改造等。水资源评价的实质是为了有效地开发保护和管理水资源,使其能够服务于整个水资源开发管理的实际工作。当前水资源在开发利用过程中还面临着许多问题,进行水资源评价时为了能够对水资源有更深入的认识,为水资源的可持续开发利用和保护提供重要的基础保障,实现水资源的良性开发和利用。</jats:p>"}, {"issue": "5", "DOI": "10.18402/resci.2018.05.14", "type": "journal-article", "page": "1016-1025", "title": ["水资源-水环境阈值耦合下的水资源系统承载力研究"], "volume": "40", "author": [{"family": "苏贤保", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "SU", "family": "Xianbao", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"family": "李勋贵", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"family": "赵军峰", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "LI", "family": "Xungui", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "ZHAO", "family": "Junfeng", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "container-title": ["资源科学", "Resources Science"], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2018]]}}, {"DOI": "10.32629/9789811463051", "title": ["濮阳市水资源承载能力研究"], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2020, 6, 1]]}, "type": "book", "abstract": "<jats:p>本书分析了目前国内外对水资源承载能力及优化配置研究的现状及发展趋势,并介绍了水资源承载力及优化配置的理论基础。以水资源的可持续开发利用为目标,建立了一套相对完整的濮阳市水资源承载力分析方法及预测模型,详细分析了濮阳市地区的自然条件、水文地质条件、社会经济情况和水资源开发利用现状及存在的问题；运用压力-状态-响应模型计算了濮阳市水资源的承载能力,并在不同的模式下,对濮阳市水资源进行供需平衡分析和合理配置,为濮阳市今后的水资源管理提供了科学依据。</jats:p>"}], "items-per-page": 5, "query": {"start-index": 0, "search-terms": null}}}